  "description": "<p>This round educational rug features a colorful feeling wheel chart, designed to help children identify and express their emotions. Its playful composition notebook style, adorned with doodles and cheerful icons, brings warmth and personality to any learning space. This rug serves as a valuable tool for emotional regulation and mindfulness in classrooms or play areas.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Colorful feeling wheel chart for emotional learning and expression.</li>\n<li>Supports emotional development and mindfulness for children.</li>\n<li>Playful composition notebook style with cheerful icons.</li>\n<li>Soft, durable, and comfortable high-quality polyester material.</li>\n<li>Machine washable for easy maintenance.</li>\n<li>Versatile for classrooms, calming corners, or play areas.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Area Rug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Round</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Indoor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Cartoon</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Wheel of Feeling</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Special Features</td>\n<td>Non Slip</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Faux Wool</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Memory Foam</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Vacuum regularly or hand/machine wash with cold water</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This versatile round rug is perfect for classrooms, therapy rooms, reading corners, and calming areas. It functions as an engaging seating mat, a welcoming classroom accent, or a comfortable addition to any play space designed to foster emotional awareness in children.</p>",
